{"version":1,"content":"<p>張敬軒於澳門倫敦人舉行的《張敬軒 x 澳門中樂團 Unplugged‧盛樂演唱會》掀起搶飛潮！</p><p>原定6場演出，昨日（27日）率先開放歌迷會會員優先內部訂購，最高峰時售票系統顯示，接近15萬名歌迷排隊輪候購票，迫爆網絡。</p><p>6場門票售罄後，主辦單位隨即宣布加開2場，場次增至8場。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:42:03.419867+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:24:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T01:38:08.580146+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:38:20.548371+00:00","content_hash":"451b3ec1fd7143274b2e83c7defbbd637abf574f67a1d529cb6d4f7068d87160","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}